    "id": 422,
    "date": "2020-01-04T20:17:40+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Map link below is planned route to the Los Angeles Airport (LAX).\n\nI have the option of taking a northern or a southern route into Los Angeles from Yucca Valley, and linking up with the Historic Route 66 near San Bernardino.\n\nEither way, I will need to travel through high traffic canyon lands, sometimes on the Interstate highway.\n\nThe northern loop touches more of old Route 66, but is nearly 200 miles longer, so I may opt for the southern loop, but not sure yet.\n\nThe markers along the way represent sights and way points along this segment of Route 66.\n\nhttps://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?mid=1UYgRC-khgjGbob6vSz_xKjcvEeQKFwAs",
