    "text": "A large, award winning public middle school adjacent to the Polliwog Park.\n\nThis is a very exclusive yet relaxed and friendly community that has not been hit hard with an invasion of homeless.\n\nIt's been like coming around to an oasis in the desert.\n\nThe amenities, the friendliness and sharing, the courtesy.\n\nEvery community has issues, but this place seems rather well protected.",
